<main id="main"><div class="page-content"><div class="page-wrap" id="careers-hero-wrap"><section class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><div class="hero-split"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Careers at RE-ViVE</p><h1 class="page-title"><span class="hero-line hero-line-one">Work on a problem</span><span class="hero-line hero-line-two">every large enterprise has.</span></h1><p class="page-intro">Orders, cases and requests move across dozens of systems before they are finished. Almost no organization can see how that actually happened. That is the problem we work on.</p><p class="page-intro">We build Execution Intelligence on the operational data of real enterprises.</p></div><aside class="hero-aside"><div aria-hidden="true" class="accent-rule"></div><p class="aside-statement">You will work with real enterprise execution data, not demo sets.</p><p>Our work starts from the systems businesses actually run on, which means the problems are concrete, the data is messy, and the results are visible to the people who own the process.</p></aside></div></div></section></div><div class="page-wrap" id="careers-why-wrap"><section class="band band-dark"><div class="shell"><div class="split-wide"><div class="split-copy"><div class="band-head"><p class="kicker">Why This Work</p><h2>Close to the systems that run the business.</h2></div><p>Most software teams are one or two steps removed from how an enterprise really operates. RE-ViVE sits directly on the execution evidence: the orders, approvals, handoffs, exceptions and reworks recorded across ERP, CRM, workflow engines and custom applications.</p><p>That proximity changes the work. Reconstructing how a single order travelled through six systems is a harder and more interesting problem than it first appears.</p></div><div class="question-card"><div aria-hidden="true" class="accent-rule"></div><p class="question">Can you make messy enterprise data tell the truth about how work ran?</p><p class="question-foot">That question sits behind almost every role here.</p></div></div></div></section></div><div class="page-wrap" id="careers-how-wrap"><section class="band"><div class="shell"><div class="split"><div class="split-copy"><div class="band-head"><p class="kicker">How We Work</p><h2>Clear ownership, real problems.</h2></div><p>Work is organized around processes and customers rather than layers of hierarchy, so the person building something usually talks directly to the person who needs it.</p><p>Because we work with production data under read-only access, care and judgement matter as much as speed.</p></div><div class="card-stack"><div class="card"><h3>Ownership over scope</h3><p>Roles here are defined by the problem you are responsible for, not by a narrow function.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Close to the customer</h3><p>Engineering, delivery and go-to-market work on the same processes rather than in separate silos.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Evidence over opinion</h3><p>The same principle we apply to customer processes applies internally: decisions follow what actually happened.</p></div></div></div></div></section></div><div class="page-wrap" id="careers-roles-wrap"><section class="band band-tint"><div class="shell"><div class="band-head"><p class="kicker">Open Roles</p><h2>Where we are hiring right now.</h2><p class="band-intro">If nothing below matches what you do, we still read every speculative application.</p></div><div class="role-list"><div class="role"><h3>Senior Data Engineer</h3><p class="role-meta"><span class="role-team">Engineering</span>Visakhapatnam, India · Full time</p><a class="role-apply" href="mailto:hr@revivetoday.com?subject=Application%3A%20Senior%20Data%20Engineer">Apply <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="role"><h3>Execution Analyst</h3><p class="role-meta"><span class="role-team">Delivery</span>Visakhapatnam, India · Full time</p><a class="role-apply" href="mailto:hr@revivetoday.com?subject=Application%3A%20Execution%20Analyst">Apply <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="role"><h3>Frontend Engineer</h3><p class="role-meta"><span class="role-team">Engineering</span>Visakhapatnam, India · Full time</p><a class="role-apply" href="mailto:hr@revivetoday.com?subject=Application%3A%20Frontend%20Engineer">Apply <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="role"><h3>Solutions Consultant</h3><p class="role-meta"><span class="role-team">Go-to-market</span>Plano, TX · Full time</p><a class="role-apply" href="mailto:hr@revivetoday.com?subject=Application%3A%20Solutions%20Consultant">Apply <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="role"><h3>Enterprise Account Executive</h3><p class="role-meta"><span class="role-team">Go-to-market</span>Plano, TX · Full time</p><a class="role-apply" href="mailto:hr@revivetoday.com?subject=Application%3A%20Enterprise%20Account%20Executive">Apply <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></div></section></div><div class="page-wrap" id="careers-process-wrap"><section class="band band-mist"><div class="shell"><div class="band-head"><p class="kicker">How Hiring Works</p><h2>Four conversations, no guesswork.</h2></div><div aria-label="Hiring process" class="step-row is-light"><div class="step-card"><span class="step-no">01</span><h3>Intro call</h3><p>A short conversation about what you have worked on and what you are looking for next.</p></div><div class="step-card"><span class="step-no">02</span><h3>Working session</h3><p>We look at a problem close to the real work, so you see the kind of thing you would be doing.</p></div><div class="step-card"><span class="step-no">03</span><h3>Meet the team</h3><p>Time with the people you would work alongside.</p></div><div class="step-card"><span class="step-no">04</span><h3>Decision</h3><p>We come back to you either way, with the reasoning behind it.</p></div></div></div></section></div><div id="cta-wrap"><section class="cta-section"><div class="shell"><div class="cta-grid"><div><h1>Tell us what you want to work on.</h1><p class="cta-sub">Speculative applications are welcome. Write to us and say what you do and where you would add to the team.</p></div><div class="action"><a class="button" href="mailto:hr@revivetoday.com?subject=Speculative%20application">Email us <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></div></section></div></div></main>
</Layout>
